# Flesh Burrower (2/2 deathtouch): "Whenever this creature attacks, another target creature you control gains deathtouch until end of
# turn." (CR 603.2, 611.2a, 702.2). Cast on turn 1 with Mox Emerald and Mox Jet; Memnite and Ornithopter are Bot1's other creatures. On
# turn 3 the Burrower attacks and the trigger may not target the Burrower itself ("another"), nor Bot2's Ornithopter (not controlled by
# Bot1); Bot1 chooses Memnite, which has deathtouch that turn (the Ornithopter does not) and does not on turn 5, while the Burrower keeps its own.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Memnite
Flesh Burrower
Island x2
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Flesh Burrower.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = (absent)
Bot1.Attack(Flesh Burrower > Bot2)
! Bot1.Target(Flesh Burrower)
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Target(Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = Deathtouch
? Bot1.Battlefield.Flesh Burrower.Keywords = Deathtouch
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying
[T5 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Flesh Burrower.Keywords = Deathtouch
